    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> lann created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14416#discussion_r4104664192\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I guess if you count the part about \"<a href=\"https://github.com/WebAssembly/component-model/blob/d1daf829e2da2293091c105121383ffbc3b3515b/design/mvp/Concurrency.md?plain=1#L339-L341\">semantic tail-calls</a>\" this really is just about the root task lifetime. Apart from maybe mentioning that here I still think \"task group\" makes sense, being analogous to a posix process group.</p>\n</blockquote>",
