    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> lann created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14416#discussion_r4105560713\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If this returns an error will it leak the <code>TaskGroup</code>? Or will the whole <code>ConcurrentState</code> get dropped immediately anyway?</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 626907945,
