    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> dicej created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14416#discussion_r4109107392\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes, that will trap and poison the store.  This was a good reminder to review the various ways a host can call into a component, cause these hooks to run, and return an error, in which case we need to poison the store even if the error happened without any guest code on the stack.  I'll push an update which covers the cases I found that weren't already covered.</p>\n</blockquote>",
