    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"memo\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4dd\" role=\"img\" title=\"memo\">:memo:</span> alexcrichton submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14416#pullrequestreview-5357240567\">PR review</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A few minor things, mostly I think a <code>*_disabled.rs</code> file would work well here, but otherwise lgtm</p>\n</blockquote>",
